    "detailed_description": "You will have to play as an elderly man who lives on the island &quot;Squid Heart&quot; and works as a lighthouse keeper. Returning from vacation, he finds that the island has been invaded by workers who plan to cut down all the trees and blow up the island. Not agreeing with this decision, Grandpa decides to engage in an unequal battle to defend his home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour task:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Destroy all the workers who have arrived on the island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Defuse the 20 explosives placed all over the island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour tools:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAxe - your main weapon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFirst aid kits - restore health in case of injury<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOpponents:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWorkers with various weapons: axes, wrenches and crowbars.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the island and find the laborers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEngage in battle and defend yourself from attacks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLook for first aid kits to restore your health<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDisarm the explosives to save the island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you protect Squid Heart from destruction? Play this exciting game and find the answer!",
